OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain this evening, perhaps heavy and
OL,7,Fthundery at first. The rain should
OL,8,Fclear by midnight with well broken
OL,9,Fcloud and rather chilly by dawn.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,12,Fspells, but cloud building with a few
OL,13,Fscattered showers. Drier and brighter
OL,14,Fagain later.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,17,Fspells and occasional heavy showers on
OL,18,FFriday. The showers lighter and well
OL,19,Fscattered on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,20,Fmore in the way of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
